
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&#8217;ve made a new video about where I draw the line with AI. I&#8217;m happy to give it the donkey work. Getting a finished post into WordPress or checking customer records against each other frees up time for the work I want to do.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The trouble starts when success at those jobs makes us trust it with judgment and taste. While AI can help me compare options and propose things to consider. I still need to make the call.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I explain it all in the video.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWaAbJO6BHQ">Watch the video on YouTube</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">You hold the map. The AI holds the shovel.</p>



